!/datasets/README.md

# ---- OS / editors
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/

# ---- Third-party evaluation data (downloaded on demand)
backend/evals/datasets/sentiment/
backend/evals/datasets/liveqa/

# ---- Playwright
frontend/test-results/
frontend/playwright-report/
